<view class="card-page">
  <text class="card-kicker">Field Privacy</text>
  <text class="card-title">逐字段隐私</text>
  <text class="card-subtitle">可见性由服务端在每次查看时执行。删除好友后，FRIENDS_ONLY 字段会在刷新时立即收回。</text>

  <view class="card-panel card-panel--accent">
    <text class="card-panel__title">三个级别的真实含义</text>
    <view class="card-meaning-grid">
      <view class="card-meaning"><text class="card-meaning__code">PUBLIC</text><text class="card-meaning__text">任何通过有效名片入口的查看者都可能看到；仍受分享撤销、过期、拉黑和服务端投影约束。</text></view>
      <view class="card-meaning"><text class="card-meaning__code">FRIENDS_ONLY</text><text class="card-meaning__text">仅双方好友关系为 ACCEPTED 且未拉黑时可见；删除好友后刷新立即收回。</text></view>
      <view class="card-meaning"><text class="card-meaning__code">PRIVATE</text><text class="card-meaning__text">只在本人受控资料域可见，不能进入公开 API、分享 query、日志或海报。</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card-form-section">
    <text class="card-section-heading">资料字段</text>
    <text class="card-section-caption">下列真实设置未包含在冻结 DTO 中，因此控件保持锁定并显示“未读取”。</text>
    <view class="card-stack">
      <ab-privacy-field
        wx:for="{{contractPendingFields}}"
        wx:key="fieldKey"
        field-key="{{item.fieldKey}}"
        label="{{item.label}}"
        visibility="{{item.visibility}}"
        disabled="{{item.disabled}}"
        sensitive="{{item.sensitive}}"
        helper="{{item.helper}}"
        bind:change="handleUnavailableChange"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card-form-section">
    <text class="card-section-heading">永久私密字段</text>
    <text class="card-section-caption">这些字段没有 PUBLIC 或 FRIENDS_ONLY 选项，客户端也不会读取具体值。</text>
    <view class="card-stack">
      <ab-privacy-field
        wx:for="{{permanentPrivateFields}}"
        wx:key="fieldKey"
        field-key="{{item.fieldKey}}"
        label="{{item.label}}"
        visibility="{{item.visibility}}"
        disabled="{{item.disabled}}"
        sensitive="{{item.sensitive}}"
        helper="{{item.helper}}"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card-status card-status--error" aria-live="polite">{{message}}</view>
  <navigator class="card-link-button" style="margin-top: 24rpx" url="/packageCard/pages/edit/index" hover-class="none">返回编辑资料</navigator>
  <view class="card-status">运行模式：{{runtimeMode}}。</view>
</view>
